# The symbols example: the core data of a compiler. It builds an expression
# tree in a node list, keeps names in a symbol table, and evaluates the tree by
# recursion. Everything the program may do is listed here.

symbols is project
symbols purpose "Build an expression tree, define its names in a symbol table, evaluate it, and print the results"
symbols target console
symbols version "0.1.0"
symbols language refined 1
symbols standardLibrary 1
symbols allows write console.stdout none
symbols requires none
symbols includesModule expressions
symbols includesModule symbols
symbols entry symbols.main
